{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/8ef33b290823f49e32df417322bf2ad3.webp?t=1769154825\" width=616 height=23 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/19e04004d08d6f579b01217f656e0c91.poster.avif?t=1769154825\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/19e04004d08d6f579b01217f656e0c91.webm?t=1769154825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/19e04004d08d6f579b01217f656e0c91.mp4?t=1769154825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Wrong Elevator</strong> is a horror game where you explore abandoned facilities and scavenge resources to maintain and upgrade your elevator.     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/8d9c638cb5a0c59e51c26e489c84e34b.webp?t=1769154825\" width=616 height=23 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/1ef2fc89700a6c802e556dba74e11e41.poster.avif?t=1769154825\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/1ef2fc89700a6c802e556dba74e11e41.webm?t=1769154825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/1ef2fc89700a6c802e556dba74e11e41.mp4?t=1769154825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to the darkest depths and explore eerie facilities. Traps and anomalies fill the corridors. Any stop you make could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/4d2b2347020ada0a1aeed144965728b9.webp?t=1769154825\" width=616 height=23 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/153bb8dfd14dbf0c23d9372eb460bdd4.poster.avif?t=1769154825\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/153bb8dfd14dbf0c23d9372eb460bdd4.webm?t=1769154825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/153bb8dfd14dbf0c23d9372eb460bdd4.mp4?t=1769154825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect as many useful items and resources as possible before you run out of fuel or a light source.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/bc46ab8a71b4ffdd7e19e7125a428f39.webp?t=1769154825\" width=616 height=23 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/3c84716760f911dcb25a196de71f160a.poster.avif?t=1769154825\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875530/extras/3c84716760f911dcb25a196de71f160a.webm?t=1769154825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.